title: "Pure Scar-Native Neural Architecture (v5.0), Mixture of Scars (MoS), SCache O(1), and Physical ScarCodec: Tabula-Rasa Pretraining on D4 Vector Lattices, End-to-End O(1) Widrow-Hoff Fast-Weights, and 100% Detached Language-Nullspace Cartridges"
