abstract: "Foundation architecture v5.0 introducing Pure Scar-Native Language Models (ScarNativeLM) pretrained from tabula rasa (step 0) without unconstrained dense Gaussian MLP soup: (1) ScarNativeLinear parameterizes every projection natively on the canonical D4 + exact (0,0,0,0) LUT256 vector lattice with orthonormal FWHT-64, bounded channel equilibration d_eq, and INT4-STE structural scars, achieving 0.0000 KL post-training export shock; (2) DifferentiableSCacheAttention trains RoPE Attention Sinks, local sliding rings, and Content-Addressed Pre-RoPE Surprise-Gated Widrow-Hoff fast-weight matrices W_scar end-to-end in O(1) memory (+0 B drift across infinite horizons) with bit-level parity across Native PyTorch and 22 pure WGSL 1.0 WebGPU compute shaders; (3) Contrastive Golden-Slice Language-Nullspace Projection (P_perp_lang) decouples 100% of mutable factual knowledge into 8 KB (8,192 B = 2 x 4 KB) zero-SGD RRR ScarStore cartridges firing across PT, EN, ES, and FR with instant 0x00 GDPR unlearning, alongside MoS v4.0 0.5B-72.71B operators and standalone physical ScarCodec."
